intent: >
  Two carry-forward misalignments that survived the brain-removal rework
  phase (steps 1-9 of plan.aide, 2026-04-28). Both were pre-existing before
  this phase; neither was regressed or introduced by it. The phase completed
  its scoped work cleanly: all tests pass, typecheck is clean, and all nine
  steps of plan.aide are checked. These items are the remaining open work
  before `status: aligned` is valid.
misalignment:
